Samdech Thep Dey Hun Manet: The seller wants the price, the buyer wants the cheap, based on this point, the state has always considered to keep a price acceptable to all (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): "Sellers want prices, buyers want cheap. Based on this, the government always considers the balance between consumers and agricultural producers to keep a price acceptable to all."
This statement was made by Samdech President Hun Manet on the occasion of announcing the official implementation of three other political programs related to the agricultural sector on the morning of November 20, 2023.
Hun Manet said that the agricultural market is not different from other markets, but it is very competitive, agricultural techniques must be constantly updated to increase efficiency, reduce prices and competitiveness.
Samdech Thep Thi Hun Manet continued that the inflation of product prices is something that the Royal Government must strive to monitor on a regular basis. As for the price of this product, the Minister of Commerce always makes a daily report to the Royal Government to make it easier to solve the problem of inflation on other goods.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia stated that when the selling price is higher, the revenue is higher and the production cost is lower, along with efforts to reduce the shipping cost, it will make our agricultural products more competitive and even more profitable. That will benefit both farmers.
At the same time, the Prime Minister urged the ministries and institutions to cooperate with a single commander is important to promote effective work to achieve good results.
The Prime Minister made the remarks on the occasion of announcing the implementation of priority political programs related to the agricultural sector on the morning of November 20, 2023 at the Ministry of Agriculture.
