National Assembly President Khuon Sodary made the remarks while presiding over a national forum on "Women in Leadership and Governance" under the theme "Women in Political and Public Decision Making". November 20, 2023 at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh, organized by the Ministry of Women's Affairs.
Despite strong efforts to focus on gender equality, there are still many challenges, especially the number of women in politics and the public sector. According to the 2023 Sustainable Development Progress Report, women make up about 26.7 percent of the legislature and 35.5 percent of the global government.
