(Phnom Penh): Dr. Hean Sahip, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Cambodia Securities Exchange, provided five key tips to the Cambodia Securities Exchange (CSX) to attract publishers and investors to invest. At CSX.
Dr. Hean Sahip's remarks on the occasion of attending the Cambodia Stock Exchange Fair was held for the 6th time for 4 days from 16 to 19 November 2023 at Aeon Mall Phnom Penh to Promote the securities sector in Cambodia.
According to Dr. Hean Sahip, in order to promote and promote the securities sector in Cambodia better and attract publishers and investors to invest in CSX, I would like to offer some important tips such as:
1: Develop a wider publicity program and highlight the long-term, medium and short-term benefits, as well as highlight the possibility of obtaining additional capital to expand production and business opportunities.
2. Increase cooperation with financial institutions, national and international business associations to establish communication networks and encourage more potential companies to list on the stock exchange.
3. Promote the provision of support services for potential companies considering listing on the stock exchange, as well as financial advice and legal assistance.
4: Establish relationships and opportunities for infrastructure companies listed on the stock exchange, which is an incentive for infrastructure development projects to benefit from public financing through the stock exchange.
5: Make a program and presentation of companies listed on the stock exchange, open opportunities for questions, answers and exchange of ideas to increase the direct participation of speakers, potential investors.
Dr. Hean Sahip added that by combining all these stimulus mechanisms, the Cambodia Securities Exchange will be able to create a more attractive environment for potential companies that are considering listing and investing, encouraging them to take advantage of This opportunity created by the Cambodia Securities Exchange.
Mr. Hong Sohour, Royal Government Representative in charge of the Director General of the Cambodia Securities Exchange, said that the Cambodia Securities Exchange has reached a new generation, the third generation of the Cambodia Securities Exchange (CSX 3.0) by opening an online trading account. Trading account immediately after the securities agent has verified the information.
Please be informed that the Cambodia Stock Exchange Expo 2023 is organized for the following main purposes:
1: Promote the securities sector in Cambodia through the dissemination and dissemination of awareness to the public, especially potential investors, both national and international investors to know and understand more about the Cambodia Securities Exchange, as well as the many benefits of this market.
2. Provide opportunities for investors and the public to learn more about the securities sector in Cambodia through face-to-face meetings with regulators, operators, securities firms, issuers and other stakeholders.
