Later, Nuon Panha had 2 arrest warrants, 1 in 2018 and 1 in 2020, and in 2020 he was arrested by the Kampong Cham Provincial Police on this warrant and he was once imprisoned. And. The suspect, Nuon Panha, is currently being held in Kampong Cham Provincial Prison.
