Phnom Penh Capital Administration Donates More Than $ 150,000 to Monks at Wat Prasidhirimaram
(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Municipal Administration donated $ 157,284 to the monks who have been waiting for the rain for a quarter of the year in Puth Seima, Wat Prasidh Rimaram to continue building temples and achievements in this temple. In Sangkat Ponsaing, Khan Prek Pnov, on the morning of November 18, 2023.
