The International Olympic Movement and the International Paralympic Movement highly commend the Royal Government, the Organizing Committee of the Cambodian People's Competition, for mobilizing all their capabilities, abilities and will to create greatness in the Olympic-Paralympic Movement in accordance with the International Olympic-Paralympic Standards.
