8: Preah Upalivong Keo Savon (Chot Thero), King of the fish class, Preah Mongkul Tip, Mr. Rainsy, Chief of Takeo Province, and Chief Bishop of Wat Tom, Sangkat Roka Krao, Daun Keo City, Takeo Province.
10: Preah Serey Visoth Vann Vanno (Thammatharo), Royal Council of Chatva, Supreme Personal Adviser, Samdech Preah Sangkhareach, Personal Adviser, Samdech Preah Sang, Principal, Director of Bun Rany Hun Sen High School, Kropeu Ha, and Chief Priest Krapeu Ha, Sangkat Prek Russey, Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
11: Preah Vinay Samvor Rin Sophon (Ind Panho), Royal Council of Chatva, Supreme Advisor, Samdech Preah Akka Moha Sangkha, Reverend Dr. Tep Vong, Samdech Preah Moha Sangkha Reach of the Kingdom of Cambodia, Preah Vinay Thor, Sub-Khan Kampoul .
