(Siem Reap): Siem Reap Angkor International Airport (SAI) worth about 1.1 billion US dollars was officially inaugurated on the morning of Thursday, November 16, 2023. This is it. The ceremony was presided over by His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The presence of Siem Reap Angkor International Airport is another great achievement in the territory of Siem Reap, a potential economic pole of Cambodia in tourism. Siem Reap Angkor International Airport has become an important air link between Siem Reap and other areas in Cambodia, as well as other potential tourism destinations.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Mani President Hun Manet's opportunity to officially inaugurate Siem Reap Angkor International Airport:
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that Samdech was pleased to be inaugurated the Siem Reap Angkor International Airport.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that Siem Reap Angkor International Airport is another historic achievement in the field of air transportation.
* Samdech Hun Manet highly commended the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation, Siem Reap Provincial Administration and relevant ministries and institutions for their close cooperation in coordinating projects with a proactive and responsible spirit from the beginning to achieve smooth and effective results. As planned.
Samdech Hun Manet stated that Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is the fruit of peace and a new outstanding achievement of Cambodia-China steel ties.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the decision to build Siem Reap Angkor International Airport was made with a long-term vision. In particular, based on two goals: development and conservation.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the decision to change the airport from 5 km from Siem Reap to 50 km from Siem Reap is to preserve the property of Khmer ancestors for a long time.
* President Hun Manet expressed the expectation that Siem Reap Angkor International Airport will have a higher capacity to receive large aircraft.
* Samdech Hun Manet is confident that in the future, Siem Reap will be bigger and Siem Reap Angkor International Airport will become an airport in the center of Siem Reap.
Samdech Hun Sen considers the construction of Siem Reap Angkor International Airport as a demonstration of the transformation of the former battlefield into a development zone with economic potential.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet The construction of the airport is a good thing, but must find ways to further develop to ensure the sustainability of operations.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the General Department of Immigration has set up an electronic system to check passengers entering Cambodia and will be the first to be implemented at Siem Reap International Airport by the end of 2023.
* Samdech Hun Manet advised to do business with Siem Reap Angkor Airport to provide economic benefits to the people of Siem Reap and other provinces.
* Samdech Hun Manet said that 2024 is a year of change in Cambodian-Chinese relations, so there will be more tourists from China.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in order for Siem Reap to be able to receive tourists again, the state has put in place a number of plans to help tour operators.
* President Hun Manet stated that despite Cambodia's difficulties due to the global economic crisis, Cambodia continues to strive to keep electricity prices low.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed Siem Reap provincial authorities to work hard to ensure security and order in the area around Siem Reap International Airport.
* President Hun Manet stated that in order to make tourism in Siem Reap more vibrant, the Royal Government will consider connecting direct flights to potential tourist destinations in other countries and expanding the scope of border card use.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet said that if there is an airport, but the lack of tourist attractions can not make the airport work well.
* President Hun Manet stated that the launch of the airport and the launch of the "Visit Siem Reap 2024" strategy is to help revive tourism in Siem Reap.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that Siem Reap Angkor International Airport will be a strong potential and important opportunity for tourism in Siem Reap, a major tourist destination in Cambodia in particular, as well as tourism and economic sectors throughout the country as a whole. .
Samdech Hun Sen warmly welcomes more Chinese people to visit Cambodia, especially to Siem Reap.
