Cambodia Securities Exchange to officially launch online trading account opening system tomorrow
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodia Securities Exchange (CSX) has announced the official launch of an online trading account opening system for investors to use on November 16, 2023.
Online trading account opening system allows investors to get an account immediately every working hour To open an online trading account, the investor has to download the Stock Exchange mobile application and requires the investor to click on the trading account to open the trading account, then select their securities company. Satisfied and fill in some information, stan, ID and face scan.
After the securities company has verified the applicant's information, the investor identification number and trading account number will be created immediately. Thus, it is easier and faster for investors to save time and money to get a trading account. After getting a trading account, investors can deposit money into the account and trade immediately.
Opening an online securities trading account is part of the first phase of the new government's Pentagon strategy under the leadership of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The Cambodia Securities Exchange hopes that in 2024, there will be an increase of 30,000 to 50,000 accounts (or almost 100% of the current number of accounts) after the launch of this system.
