Articles and pictures by Cambodia-China Friendship Radio Key remarks by Samdech Hun Sen President Opportunity to Inaugurate Koh Nora Bridge
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Wednesday, November 15, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, officially inaugurated the Koh Nora Bridge.
Koh Nora Bridge is a cable-stayed concrete bridge across the Bassac River connecting the Koh Pich Development Zone and the Koh Nora Development Zone. The construction site of Koh Nora Bridge was opened on October 26, 2020 under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, former Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet, the opportunity to inaugurate the Koh Nora Bridge:
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet expressed his pleasure to inaugurate the inauguration of Koh Nora Bridge and Koh Nora Twin Dragon Bridge.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet thanked the people who went to the polls on July 23, 2023.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet thanked the authorities in Phnom Penh for their contribution to the development of Koh Nora.
* President Hun Manet stated that infrastructure is very important for the nation. Infrastructure is the lifeblood of the nation.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet used to connect only by land, water and air, now there is another road, digital road. This digital route connects fast.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet spoke in support of the development of Koh Nora, considering this development as a special development.
Samdech Hun Sen considers the development of Koh Nora to be a reflection of the status of the island, which was previously stranded and has become a place with high economic potential.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the development of Koh Nora is the distribution of profits to the people, not just for Duke Pung Kheav Se or a handful of people.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the development of Koh Nora will expand the economic benefits to Chbar Ampov and Chamkarmon as well.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's development policy is for all citizens to benefit.
Samdech Hun Sen expressed hope that Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Se Company will continue to pay attention to the development of Koh Nora as planned.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet requested banks and financial institutions to take care to facilitate credit to alleviate the difficulties of borrowers.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the policy for foreigners to rent houses and rent land for a long time will continue to be in accordance with the Constitution and will not allow foreigners, both physical and legal persons, to occupy Cambodian land.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed the Phnom Penh Unity Command to strengthen security, safety and public order to prevent all social unrest, especially during the Water Festival, floating lanterns, worshiping the moon and dancing.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed the Phnom Penh Capital Administration to consider facilitating traffic flow after the commissioning of the Koh Nora Bridge.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet instructed the Phnom Penh Capital Administration to strengthen the provision of transportation services in Phnom Penh by deploying additional bus lines to Koh Nora and other development areas.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet wants to study the preparation of roads for public buses to facilitate public bus traffic.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed his intention to study the air and subway in Phnom Penh to facilitate traffic.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet wants to study the geography of Phnom Penh by organizing it as a green area, a business area and a separate entertainment area.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed the Phnom Penh Capital Administration to pay attention to strengthening the policy of safe villages, communes and sangkats in order to strengthen public order, prevent burglary and security for tourists.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that four shooters in Kirirom were expelled.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the security of some European countries where Samdech used to live was inferior to Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that now there are cockroaches in the air and raining online. The Royal Government will make efforts to prevent it.
