The above arrest was made at 7:40 pm on November 14, 2023 at the northern point of Apsara Rice Mill, Srah Kay Village, Sangkat Veang Chas, Udong Mechey City, Kampong Speu Province.
Udong Mechey police said that a motorcycle robbery occurred because the assailant used a sharp knife to cut and stab the victim to rob the motorcycle while drinking with The victim and the suspect were acquaintances on the afternoon of the same day.
The police further said that the victim was named Noy Channai, 22 years old, a factory worker living in Romlech village, Sangkat Preah Sre, Udong Me Chey city, while the perpetrator was named Pich Ravy, 20 years old, a factory worker living in Trapeang Putra village, Tumnup Thom commune. Ponhea Leu District, Kandal Province.
In this case, the specialized police force arrived at the scene to investigate and arrested the perpetrator as a factory worker working with the victim. Police later confiscated a knife, a pair of shoes and six cans of beer.
