Russia's Minister of Natural Resources visits North Korea amid reports of missile program development
Russia wants to develop "multi-sectoral cooperation" with North Korea, based on an agreement reached between President Vladimir Putin and North Korean President Kim Jong Un during a September meeting on Russian soil, the KCNA reported.
The KCNA also reported Wednesday that North Korea has successfully developed and tested a "new series of solid fuel engines" for medium-range ballistic missiles. South Korea's intelligence agency said in November that North Korea was in the final stages of preparing for the launch of a spy satellite and was likely to receive technical assistance from Russia.
Addressing the meeting, Indonesian Defense Minister Prabowo Subinto congratulated and thanked Cambodia for successfully hosting the 16th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting in 2022. And through the meeting in Cambodia, Indonesia is committed to continuing the results that Cambodia has achieved.
The Indonesian Defense Minister added that the 17th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting 2023 will continue to seek to enhance and strengthen security policies as well as promote a global environment. He called on the 17th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting to discuss ways to address issues such as regional issues.
The 17th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting 2023 in Indonesia was held under the theme "Peace, Prosperity and Security", focusing on discussions on enhancing defense cooperation, strengthening trust and capacity building. Regional resilience to address security challenges The ASEAN Defense Ministers exchanged views on regional and international issues of common concern and interest.
It should be noted that the 17th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting in Indonesia was also attended by East Timorese Defense Ministers who attended the meeting as observers.
Kathin Solidarity of Kratie Provincial Administration Will Parade to Donate Monks to 2 Pagodas, Collect 63,674,000 Riels and 2,625 USD
(Kratie): Kratie Provincial Administration, initiated by Mr. Vathorn, Governor of Kratie Province and Mr. Hoeur Siyem, Chairman of the Provincial Council, organized a procession of monks to pay homage to Preah Ratanatray Chamroeun Preah Berit and give a sermon at the Raksmey Samaki Kathen Ceremony. To the monks who have been waiting for the rain for three quarters.
In this ceremony, with the participation of a large number of leaders of government officials in departments around the province, city officials, districts and Buddhists near and far.
According to tradition and tradition, Kathina is a traditional Buddhist festival that Cambodians start after the rainy season. Kathin festival is always paraded in all temples from the 1st day of the lunar month to the 15th day of the lunar month, no pagoda is missed.
The Kathin procession to each temple is celebrated with great rejoicing, and the initiators always prepare the Kathina equipment, such as the trident, the sash, and other gifts such as the bottom of the plate, the knife, the needle, the needle, the guard bag, and the umbrella. Let's march to the designated temple.
(Jiangsu, China): On the afternoon of November 14, 2023, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, led a delegation from Preah Sihanouk Province to pay a courtesy call on Mr. Si Kunlin, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province. His go there.
Mr. Xi Kunlin, Governor of Jiangsu Province, extended a warm welcome to Mr. Kouch Chamroeun and all the delegates of Sihanoukville Province who are currently visiting Jiangsu Province.
After briefly briefing on the economic and social development of Jiangsu Province, Xi Jinping affirmed that the People's Republic of China and the Kingdom of Cambodia have deep traditional friendly relations and important consensus reached by the leaders of the two countries. Two indicated directions for deepening regional cooperation.
Mr. Si Kunlin considered Sihanoukville as an important gateway for Cambodia to open to the outside world, and Sihanoukville is a friendly province of Jiangsu and an important partner for Jiangsu to participate in. The joint construction of the "Belt and Road" and the cooperation between the two provinces have achieved fruitful results and will continue to intensify.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun thanked Mr. Jiang Zemin, Governor of Jiangsu Province for his support for the development of Sihanoukville, especially for the Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone.
He said that Sihanoukville is the focus of the "Belt and Road Initiative" and that the construction of the Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone has received strong attention from the leaders of the two countries and has contributed greatly. Important in the economic development of Cambodia.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun hopes that the two provinces will cooperate closely in the fields of economy, trade and humanitarian affairs, and more and more Jiangsu enterprises will invest in Sihanoukville to achieve common prosperity and benefit the people of the two provinces. .
On that occasion, the Governor of Sihanoukville Province also asked the Governor of Jiangsu Province to support the resumption of direct flights from Wuxi to Sihanoukville after a short break due to Kovid and to encourage investors in Jiangsu Province. Sum to invest more in Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone.
Mr. Si Kunlin accepted and supported Mr. Kouch Chamroeun's proposal and continued to strengthen the cooperation between Sihanoukville-Jiangsu Province and Sihanoukville-Wuxi in the fields of economy, industry, trade, investment, tourism and culture. Minister of Land Management urges Kandal provincial officials to register land in their area as planned
