On that occasion, the Deputy Prime Minister also handed over some technical equipment and office equipment for systematic land registration to the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs of Kandal Province.
At the same time, the provincial administration has also launched a campaign to issue land titles to people in the form of real estate, gifts, deductions or zero tax from April 2023 to November 2023, measuring plots to complete the procedure in both cadastral and Taxes have been completed and 28,584 titles have been handed over to the people. General Department of Customs issues clarification on the seizure of goods stored at Takeo Provincial Customs and Excise Branch
In this regard, the General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia is honored to inform the public that the goods that have been inspected for compliance (through the implementation of the central mechanism) have been seized and stored at the Takeo Customs and Excise Branch. The smuggled goods through the corridors (Samsung cars) and the border with Vietnam are collected in passenger cars and other trucks without import tax receipts and taxes and related documents.
In addition, some of these goods are limited goods that require a permit or license from the relevant ministries and institutions before they can be imported (according to Sub-Decree No. 17 dated February 26, 2020) and goods Others were burnt (frozen meat and seafood).
Separately, the calculation of tax and import tax shall be based on the actual purchase price and tax rate according to the type of goods stated in the Cambodian Customs Tariff in force and no Customs and Excise officials have the right to decide on the increase or reduction. Taxes and fees, as mentioned and allegations without proper basis of the traders and the media.
