(Siem Reap): The inter-ministerial working group and the Department of Rural Development led by Mr. Nuon Danil, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development inspected and evaluated the quality of the road after repairing one hundred percent damaged by floods and overweight trucks in the district. Sotnikum and Chi Kreng district, Siem Reap province.
Mr. Touch Mala, Director of the Department of Rural Development of Siem Reap Province, said that this road is more than 12 kilometers long in Tayek and Pong Leu communes and has a width of 6 meters. By the Department of Rural Development.
He said that the road was repaired for three months from July to October 2023, which is now 100 percent complete.
Mr. Touch Mala added that the red gravel road had been built by the Ministry of Rural Development since 2019, but was severely damaged, making it difficult to travel, with major landslides due to floods and overweight trucks. It makes it difficult to travel while the area is rich in agricultural crops such as potatoes and cashews.
The director of the Siem Reap Provincial Department of Rural Development confirmed that the committee of the Ministry of Rural Development recognized the quality one hundred percent after evaluating the results, because this road is important for the benefit of the people to travel to Markets, hospitals, pagodas, schools and other public services.
According to a report by the Siem Reap Provincial Department of Rural Development, more than 68 rural roads were damaged by floods during October 2023, including flooded roads. Filter bare feet and so on.
