(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of November 14, 2023, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, presided over the religious ceremony of Krong Pali to ask the landlord for peace in front of the concrete bridge connecting the island development area. Nora and Koh Pich, which will be officially inaugurated on November 15 tomorrow.
As planned, the cable-stayed concrete bridge connecting Koh Nora and Koh Pich will be officially inaugurated on the afternoon of November 15, 2023 under the presidency of His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Traditionally, the Khmer tradition before the inauguration of the newly built achievements or before the start of construction to make the construction run smoothly and happily for the users of those achievements.
The cable-stayed concrete bridge connecting Koh Nora-Koh Pich is another new achievement in Phnom Penh under the leadership of Samdech Hun Manet and led by Mr. Khuong Sreng and built by OCIC.
The bridge has played an important role in reducing traffic congestion on Norodom Boulevard from the flyover to the center of the city, including commuters from Chbar Ampov district, and has largely reduced traffic congestion on the stretch. National Road No. 1 and National Road No. 2, which is also the entrance to Phnom Penh.
Authorities ban vendors from selling goods on public roads beyond the designated area around Prey Veng Market
(Prey Veng): The Prey Veng Provincial Security and Public Order Commission, in cooperation with the Market Commission, led by Mr. Tes Saban, Prey Veng City Hall Administration Director and Deputy Chairman of the Old Market Public Order Commission, on November 14, 2023, continued to implement order and alarm. Remind traders not to place goods on public roads beyond the designated area around Prey Veng Market for order.
This action is due to the fact that there are still some traders who continue to sell goods above the limit on the streets around the market every day without order.
Mr. Tes Sa said that this is not the first time that the provincial and municipal authorities have organized order in Prey Veng market, but as a result, like a wolf in the water, but some traders he also followed the instructions of the committee. Preparation for the market order as well. Today, the committee also instructed and sprayed to determine the location for sale and prohibited places on the street.
He said that the market order committee continues to organize and require vendors to remove umbrellas from the street or the middle of the road because it is a public road: not allowing them to sell on the street. In case the trader protests or does not cooperate with the authorities, the commission will follow the law.
He stated that the purpose of the Market Order Organizing Committee is to avoid harm to the health of the people and security, public order and affect the traffic of the general public.
Not only that, it also affects the prevention, prevention and easy to rescue when problems occur eventually, such as fire. It also affects the aesthetics of the market and the sanitation environment, so the commission hopes and believes that public street vendors will voluntarily cooperate with the commission from now on.
