(Phnom Penh): Mr. Aphisandit Dr. Sar Sokha, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and Honorary President of the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia, advised all association leaders to strengthen their capacity to manage and fill in the gaps. To increase the confidence and trust of more than 70,000 members today.
He added that the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia has been growing steadily in quantity and quality from one mandate to another, which currently has 78,069 members, with a remaining budget of more than 18 billion riels, which is a significant amount. Marks can enable the association to strengthen its capacity to help its members better.
At the same time, Deputy Prime Minister Sar Sokha sincerely commended the great achievements of the Cambodian National Police in the past in the cause of maintaining security, public order and social security, and he considered this work to be invaluable. Due to the lack of peace at all stages of construction and development in the past, development is also impossible.
In order to contribute to the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia to run more efficiently, Deputy Prime Minister Sar Sokha, Honorary President, has issued the following guidelines:
* First, in the future, the association will be able to face some issues that will be resolved immediately, so I would like to suggest that the new Central Committee have a full and regular meeting to review the leadership to resolve any issues that arise. Timely and direct the local committee to be effective
* Second: At present, the Ministry of Interior has established a number of general departments and sub-departments and sub-units have also been established, so it is necessary to coordinate the reorganization of local committees by departments and units in order to have organized organizations and structures in accordance with the statute and Standards letter of the association in force
* Third: In the past, local commissions have done well, but some of the work that he observed was that some sub-national officials did not fulfill their obligations, especially in facilitating funeral arrangements. To such officials, he urged the association to review the special work, request the new mandate committee to consider establishing a working group to implement the remaining work.
* Fourth: The budget of the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia is sufficient, but the opening and providing of allowances to the families of the bodies of the members of the association is slow, sometimes for a month, sometimes up to 2 months, so this work, Mr. The new chairman is requested to review the application procedure no later than 12 business days, which is a reasonable time.
* Fifth, for the dissemination, you would like to request the committee to write the police magazine to increase the dissemination of the activities of the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia, especially the activities of the local committee to help organize the funeral of the deceased to reflect the Solidarity sentiments of national police officers at the local level
