Mr. Hay Nguon Ly said that the organization of outreach and consultation forums is an important tool for promoting accountability, transparency and participation of both men and women in the governance process of the Council of Sub-National Administration.
It should be noted that the outreach and consultation forum has answered and clarified 7 questions and suggestions and the remaining 6 requests will be discussed and resolved later according to each type of administration.
