(Siem Reap): The Siem Reap Municipal Sub-District Office on November 13, 2023 decided to close the Po Langka Pagoda in Slor Kram Village, Sangkat Slor Kram, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province after the monks in the pagoda created endless relics. Longevity for years. In the case of the expulsion of the monks from the pagoda of Po Lanka, some monks did not follow the dharma and discipline of Buddhism and also divided the party into four groups in the pagoda of Po Lanka.
Rev. Tep Phoeun, Provincial Discipline and Spokesperson of the Siem Reap Provincial Council, affirmed that the decision to temporarily close the Po Langka pagoda was made in accordance with the decision of the Board of Directors of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The position of the management team of Wat Po Lanka after the irregularities in the management of the pagoda. He said that after this decision, the provincial and municipal priests will reorganize the pagoda.
According to the decision of the Board of Priests No. 107 dated September 27, 2023, decided to terminate the position of the Board of Priests of Wat Po Langka, including:
* First: End the position of Bhikkhu Keo Khoy from the Chief Inspector * Second: End the position of Bhikkhu Pich David from the right teacher * Third: End the position of Bhikkhu Sinsin from the left teacher * Fourth: End the position of Bhikkhu Seng Sokhom From discipline.
In particular, according to the announcement dated November 13 of the Siem Reap Municipal Sub-District, said that the Siem Reap Sub-Municipal Court would like to thank all the monks, nuns, grandparents, lay people, students and those who are staying in the Po Langka pagoda. It is known that the Municipal Sub-City Hall would like to announce the dismissal of all monks and nuns in Po Lanka Pagoda to go to the pagodas in Siem Reap City.
The Sub-Municipality will not allow any person to continue to stay in Wat Po Langka, if any person refuses to leave according to this notice, the Sub-Municipality will cooperate with the competent force to enforce the law without taking responsibility for the loss. Or damage to any property.
Involved in the closure of the Po Lanka pagoda, the people at the foot of the pagoda are very enthusiastic because the monks in this pagoda have formed factions and have always caused conflicts in the pagoda for many years. The people expect that the activities of the chief priests and priests of this province will turn this temple into a place of worship for Buddhists again.
