(Phnom Penh): A delegation of the Lim Family Association of Cambodia attended the 18th Lim World Clan General Assembly in Malaysia on November 11 and 12, 2023, with the expectation of attracting investors, businessmen, tourists and international business people. More investment and visit to Cambodia.
The two-day 18th Lim World Congress in Malaysia was attended by thousands of people from more than 50 countries, including representatives of the 16 Lim clans in China.
In an interview with Fresh News Agency, Mr. Lim Sinath, President of the Lim Clan Association of Cambodia, said that on the way to attend the World Lim Clan General Assembly, the Lim Clan Association of Cambodia will strive to attract investors, businessmen, tourists, international business people to invest and Visit Cambodia more.
Mr. Lim Sinath said that a group of young people who are all descendants of the Lim family in Cambodia will meet with the Lim Chamber of Commerce in Malaysia to seek cooperation on investment, trade, tourism, business to attract international business people to invest. Invest in Cambodia. In addition, he will meet with the Lim Family Association in Japan, Taiwan, Hong Kong, Thailand and other countries.
With this expectation, Mr. Lim Sinath also confirmed that the young elders who attended the General Assembly are all business people and important job positions, that is, from all sectors such as trade, tourism, agriculture, real estate, full of experience. And can use more than 3-4 foreign languages.
According to the young president, the Lim Kampuchea Association in 2010 had already hosted the World Lim Clan General Assembly, and for the 2023 convention, the Lim Kampuchea delegation will try to negotiate to attract the convention to support Cambodia as the owner. House for the upcoming 19th Congress in 2024.
Mr. Lim Sinath considered that inviting the Lim Kampuchea Clan Association to participate in this General Assembly is a big face for the Cambodian nation as well, known as "Cambodia is small but has a big heart."
Lim Boreth, President of the Lim Clan Association of Cambodia, in an interview with Fresh News this morning, 11 November, before leaving Phnom Penh International Airport, said that the 18th Lim Clan World Congress in Malaysia 2 Today, there will be Lim family associations from many countries that will provide opportunities for the Lim family association in Cambodia to negotiate and attract investors to Cambodia, especially to join the Royal Government of Cambodia in socio-economic development.
President Lim Boreth saw the efforts of His Excellency Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, to attract foreign investors, to buy products from Cambodia, to attract foreign tourists to visit Cambodia, and so on. Participate in this work with the Royal Government as much as possible.
The President of the Lim Kampuchea Association and the participating delegates are committed to promoting investment opportunities in Cambodia, the environment in which the Royal Government promotes foreign investors, as well as the peace factor, the development that is conducive to investment by investors and the visit of tourists. From abroad.
As a result of the meeting of the partners during the General Assembly, the youth group of the Lim Family Association of Cambodia confirmed that the Lim Family World Youth Association has decided to hold the 5th anniversary of the establishment of the Lim World Family Youth Group in Cambodia. During November 2024. At the beginning of 2024, there will be a visit by the Lim World Youth Group to Cambodia, which are all business owners and investors
The Lim Cambodian Youth Group also met with the Lim family in Malaysia, in some provinces of China, Japan, Taiwan, Hong Kong, Thailand, the Philippines, Myanmar, Indonesia and other countries.
