(Kampong Speu): On the morning of November 13, 2023, at more than 7 am, a case of electric shock occurred at the southern point of the palm fruit round bridge in Tros Sala village, Svay Kravan commune, Chbar Morn city, Kampong Speu province, but after a while The police cracked down immediately.
According to witnesses at the scene, before the incident, the victim, San Raksmey, a 27-year-old female resident of Bak Thmean village, Roleang Chak commune, Samrong Tong district, Kampong Speu province, rode a motorbike from Kampong Speu market to her home.
On the way to the scene, an unidentified suspect riding a black Honda C125 motorcycle with no license plate and wearing a license plate on the victim's motorcycle from the left and intervened to shock the necklace. Pulled a piece and hurried to escape to the west. The victim shouted for help and relatives reported to the police immediately.
Immediately after receiving the information, the Judicial Police, in cooperation with the Light Crimes Bureau, the Svay Kravan Police Force and the Chbar Morn Municipal Gendarmerie, chased the suspect on a motorbike to Prasat village, Moha Saing commune, Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province. One named Sok Samnang, 35 years old, resides in Kraing Lhong village, Moha Saing commune, Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province.
According to the police, after being interrogated at the Kampong Speu Provincial Police Office of Minor Offenses, the suspect confessed that he had actually shocked the necklace and was arrested immediately.
Authorities said that the above case has built a case to the Criminal Police Plan, Kampong Speu Provincial Police Commissioner for further proceedings.
