Understand the business: Rice traders raise the demand for rice, the "veil of happiness" in the Chinese and European markets, where farmers should seize the opportunity to grow crops to boost exports
(Phnom Penh): "Veay Mongkul" rice, which was registered as a collective rice brand in June 2022, is in high demand in the Chinese and European markets as Cambodian farmers have been increasing the cultivation of this type of rice for Export also.
Oknha Song Saran, Chairman of the Board of the Cambodian Rice Federation and CEO of Amru Rice Exporters, said that the Mongkol rice is grown by many farmers in Pursat and Battambang provinces after the Cambodian Agricultural Research and Development Institute. CARDI is trying to create and encourage farmers to start production for export.
He noted that lately, this type of sourdough rice is in high demand in the Chinese and European markets, which makes Mongkul sourdough rice more marketable and good price, helping farmers to grow profitably.
"Nowadays, the Mongkol rice is grown by farmers in the production area to make cakes for sale, but we are trying to expand our cultivation to export to China because they need this kind of Mongkol rice," he said. Much of the EU market is also in demand. Therefore, I believe that this Cambodian rice brand will compete in the market in the future to get both export volume and quality in accordance with the standard.
Mr. Lor Bonna, Director of the Agricultural Research and Development Institute of Cambodia, explained that this is the first variety that was released to farmers in 2013. Sangkum rice is a seasonal rice variety that farmers can usually collect in mid-December.
Mr. In Sovanmony, Deputy Director of Battambang Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, said that the Provincial Department of Agriculture is currently urging farmers in Maung Russey district to increase the cultivation of sorghum rice on more than 200 hectares and can yield. Thousands of tons to supply on the market.
He said, "In the past, the Provincial Department of Agriculture has shown the rice varieties to Mongkul rice mills to export rice to foreign markets, they see a lot of interest in Mongkol rice, but the company and farmers do not Haven't met in person yet. "But in this rice market, middlemen collect rice from all farmers, especially traders from Vietnam, because it is very pure and sticky."
Mr. In Sovanmony said, "On behalf of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Battambang Province, the Department of Agriculture has always paid attention to and encouraged potential production chains in the villages and communes. If the external market really exists, the Department of Agriculture "We will encourage farmers to expand the production area of Mongkol rice, in addition to Maung Russey, Thmor Koul, Bovilum and Banan districts."
Please be informed that Mongkul rice seed was registered by the Ministry of Commerce in June 2022 to establish the identity of fragrant rice and Cambodian sour rice in competition with similar fragrant rice of other fragrant rice producing countries.
