The Royal Government has decided to officially launch the Chakra Strategy on November 15.
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government has decided to promulgate the new Environmental Chakra Strategy 2023-2028 based on three main priorities: clean, green and sustainable, towards achieving carbon neutrality on November 15. The coming 2023. This is according to the release of the Ministry of Environment on November 10, 2023.
