This announcement was made on the occasion of Mr. Chea Vandeth presiding over the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of community technology centers at public high schools in Takeo province on the morning of November 10, 2023.
Mr. Chea Vandeth stated, "Currently, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications is cooperating with other ministries to ensure that all ministries have the means to turn their ministries into digital ministries. Provide public services, all communication through the online system.
In addition, Mr. Chea Vandeth said that to achieve this goal:
First, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications is connecting Internet and telephone services to all ministries and institutions. Second: Prepare sub-decree to establish digital transformation units in each ministry and each state institution. To become a state system.
He said that all ministries will no longer use private equipment in the next year or two, and the ministry will provide computers to all ministries and institutions for government officials to use state-owned to maintain all data of work. Of the state in the ministry by not allowing those who use private equipment when transferring to another place to take all the documents with you.
Fourth, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications, as the Chairman of the Digital Government Commission, facilitates and prepares action plans in cooperation with the relevant ministries to ensure that each concerned ministry has its own action plan within 1 year, 3 years, 5 years. In consideration to turn its ministry into a digital ministry.
Fifth, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications and all relevant ministries cooperate to develop technology nurseries so that this technology nursery provides internal government services from one ministry to another, provides services from ministry to business by providing services from ministry to people. Online.
At the same time, he said that the establishment of community technology centers in public high schools is a reflection of the long-term vision within the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Information Technology to fulfill the mission of the digital transformation initiative to education that will contribute. To human resource development and the digital future of Cambodia.
Please note that "Community Technology Center" is a center that provides training related to digital technology skills and postal services to people in the community, especially to students and the local community in order to promote digital human resource training, digital literacy and cutting. Reduce the digital gap.
