Samdech Hun Manet stated that the development of the Special Forces Command is inseparable from the key figure, Chap Pheakdey, now Secretary of State at the Ministry of National Defense, a former commander of the Special Forces Command, which has led the unit for 28 years. Come here by building and achieving many achievements.
Soldier training in Special Forces Command not only for the unit but for the entire army. The establishment of the Techo Sen Oral Military Academy, as well as the Diving School, was the result of special efforts by the Commander of the Special Forces.
This statement by Samdech President Hun Manet took the opportunity to preside over the celebration of the 28th anniversary of the establishment of the Special Forces Command.
President Hun Manet said that no one could have predicted whether Cambodia would have a terrorist attack or not, so it was necessary to strengthen counter-terrorism capabilities at any time. He also instructed the Ministry of Defense and all military commanders to pay attention to technological security threats.
At the same time, Samdech President Hun Manet said that the fight against disasters also requires additional equipment to expand the rescue capacity. The Royal Government continues to focus on strengthening the capacity of the army to strengthen national defense.
At the same time, Samdech Thipadei also reminded about the situation of parachuting training troops, which previously had no training place, lack of jumping place, etc., but later, with the support of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a training school in Oral was established to train parachuting. Terrorism and special forces.
