Samdech Samdech Hun Manet also brought the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to all officers, deputies and soldiers of the Special Forces Command.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet praised and highly appreciated the female warriors of the Special Forces Command who sacrificed for the cause of the nation and the people.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet praised and highly appreciated the troops of the Special Forces Command for their active participation in society, especially in rescuing people during disasters.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet praised all the paratroopers who jumped on good targets.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet also reminded about the training situation of the parachuting army, which previously lacked a training place, lacked a place to jump and so on. But later, with the support of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a training school in Oral was set up to train anti-terrorism paratroopers and special forces.
* President Hun Manet stated that peace is important and hoped that Cambodia would not have a large-scale battle like the one overthrowing the Pol Pot regime.
Samdech Hun Sen hopes that the Special Forces Command will continue to play an important role in the field of national defense.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the new Royal Government of Cambodia will continue to adhere to the policy of "protection for development, development for protection".
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government continues to pay attention to strengthening the capacity of the army to strengthen national defense.
* President Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government continues to cooperate with the United Nations to participate in peacekeeping missions.
* President Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government will modernize three tasks in the field of national defense, including modernization of infrastructure, modernization of training and modernization of equipment.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in recent years, there have been many changes in the leadership structure of the Army, Navy and Air Force.
* President Hun Manet stated that the fight against disasters requires additional equipment to expand the rescue capacity.
* Samdech Manipur Hun Manet instructed the Ministry of Defense and all military commanders to pay attention to threats from security and technology security.
* President Hun Manet stated that training is important to pay attention to strengthen the military capacity.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the training must be strengthened from the lower level. He compared that teaching is not strong from primary to secondary learning.
Samdech Hun Manet stated that the army needs to operate in groups of at least one group of three.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to inspect the military training school in 3 levels independently and interconnected cells.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet requested the provincial governor to facilitate the provision of locations for army training.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet issued 5 recommendations to all Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
* President Hun Manet stated that the army must be loyal to the nation and the people.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised to pay attention to the use of materials and strength in accordance with the needs and skills.
* Samdech Hun Manet advised all units to strengthen training to build human resources to serve national defense effectively.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised all military units to be ready with the means and forces to come to the rescue in case of any disaster.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed all military units to build the economy on the spot, such as planting and raising animals.
