This recommendation was made on the occasion of Samdech's celebration of the 28th anniversary of the establishment of the Special Forces Command on the morning of November 10, 2023.
Samdech Hun Manet issued five recommendations to all units of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces to implement as follows:
First, the army must be a highly professional army that is absolutely loyal to the motherland and the people and wholeheartedly obeys all regulations, circulars, guides, statutes of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, legal norms, adheres to the traditions, dignity of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and becomes a force. True to protect the motherland and the people.
Second, all units must pay the utmost attention to the use of force, resources and assets of the unit to be stable and effective, that is, to use force in accordance with the needs and skills and to manage the maintenance of weapons, military equipment. Everything, as well as food, etc., properly and sustainably.
Third, all units must strengthen the training, learning and building human resources, both quantitatively and qualitatively, to serve the national defense effectively, especially all units must strengthen the skills development of the military in accordance with the duties.
Fourth, all units should pay attention to prepare all means and means to help rescue people in the event of an accident, with a proactive spirit and close cooperation with local authorities and ministries. Relevant institutions.
Fifth, the unit should promote economic development on the spot, such as farming and animal husbandry, in order to contribute to improving the living standards of the army and families, providing comfort, well-being, and productivity in carrying out their missions.
