(Siem Reap): Siem Reap provincial police decided to detonate weapons to crack down on counterfeit money swindlers in Boeung Don Pa village, Slor Kram commune, Siem Reap city, arresting six suspects with several counterfeit dollars and two cars. Accessories.
The report of the Siem Reap Provincial Police, obtained by Fresh News on November 9, 2023, states that on the night of November 7, 2023, the specialized police force received a report from a victim living in Chrey village. Sangkat Teuk Vil, Siem Reap City, claiming that a group of suspects swindled his money by taking $ 5,000 in exchange for 177,500 baht, giving the victim a 40 percent profit.
After receiving this information, the specialized force immediately launched an operation to crack down, but then the suspects came to their senses and drove the car to hit the police, damaging a motorcycle, then the force fired in self-defense by shooting. Two suspects were hit by a car at the eastern end of Sokha Hotel, 60 meters from Boeung Don Pa village, Slor Kram commune, Siem Reap city.
The suspects then drove away to the front of Puok Market, where they, in cooperation with the Puok District Police Inspectorate and the Intervention Force, arrested six suspects and two vehicles.
