November 9 This year marks the 70th anniversary of Cambodia's independence from the French colony.
(Phnom Penh): On November 9, 2023, this is the 70th anniversary of the complete liberation of the entire Cambodian nation from the French colony under the ferocious crusade led by the King of Cambodia, His Majesty the King. Samdech Norodom Sihanouk.
The celebration of the anniversary of independence was celebrated in full force under the presidency of the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, the son of King Norodom Sihanouk, the Father of Cambodian Independence. The ceremony was also attended by congratulations from senior leaders of the Royal Government, government officials, students, youth and many more people.
