Remarks by His Excellency Hun Manet on the Occasion of Celebrating the 70th Anniversary of National Independence Day, November 9, and the Birth of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces on November 9, 2023 under His Majesty King Bhumibol Adulyadej His Majesty Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia.
His Excellency Hun Manet stated that the process of Khmer national development has reached a new stage where we all have strong confidence and high ambition to raise the Khmer national pride as high as Angkor era through nation building. A strong, vibrant, prosperous and prosperous country, becoming a high-income country by 2050.
First, protect peace, protect independence, sovereignty, territorial integrity and protect all achievements of the society to be stable.
Second, to build the Kingdom of Cambodia into a liberal, multi-party democracy that is progressive and strong based on the rule of law, has a sustainable and equitable economic growth, has a prosperous people, lives in harmony, with dignity, and has Respect human rights.
Third, to build a social protection system that is environmentally friendly, efficient and financially sustainable, which ensures the provision of protection to people in response to economic risks, public health risks and other vulnerabilities.
Fourth, to promote the implementation of "Cambodia Mine-Free by 2025" and reduce unexploded ordnance to a maximum.
Fifth, continue to pursue an independent foreign policy based on the rule of law, build better friendship and cooperation with all countries in the world, and actively participate in the cause of peace, stability, security and prosperity in the region and the world.
