Workshop on the Royal Government of Cambodia's policy to implement measures in line with international best practices to provide cross-border trade facilitation in order to increase Cambodia's competitiveness in international markets. The full implementation of customs procedures before the goods arrive, the implementation of electronic forms instead of paper forms and the simplification of customs procedures are the main action plans that the ECCC must achieve.
