Please be informed that the daughter named Leang Hem Vatey was arrested by the police and sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
The origin of the story of the daughter who stabbed her parents to death was born in (Borei Mondani), the 10th project, because he wanted to go out of the house, but the parents refused to let him out, so they argued to the point of using violence to take a knife. Injected on parents at 7 pm on November 4, 2023 in Ta An village, Sangkat Snor, Khan Kambol.
After the incident, the father was rushed to the hospital, but unfortunately he died and the mother was seriously injured. The perpetrator's daughter was immediately arrested while trying to hide in a neighbor's house.
According to some reports, the daughter is suspected of having a mental illness.
