Samdech Hun Manet said that the port of Sihanoukville has container traffic, while it is planned to have only 550,000 containers per year, but in recent years there are more than 750,000 mobile containers. Therefore, to meet the needs of the Royal Government, expand this port to be bigger and deeper.
"We have done a lot in the past, now we are modifying the container space to ship, but more importantly, we have worked with Japan to invest in the expansion of our first deep-sea port, I hope. That will hit the foundation before the end of 2003. "
