During the ceremony, the President stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia, the seventh mandate, is a phase that needs to be strengthened rather than expanded, and this strengthening is focused on services and results focused on the local level. Issued six urgent priority policies, including five key rules in addition to other policies in the first phase of the strategy.
