Ministry of Information launches reforms to improve national media effectiveness and capacity building, as well as encourage state information officials
(Siem Reap): More than two months of the Ministry of Information's reform in the seventh mandate, the Royal Government's media has gained significant momentum, equal to the private media and began to jump. This is according to Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, speaking at a meeting with leaders and officials of the Siem Reap Provincial Information Department on November 3, 2023.
