In a statement obtained by Fresh News on November 2, 2023, the Prey Veng Provincial Police confirmed that in accordance with the order of General Sar Thet, the National Police Commissioner, the 11 police officers were sent to Drug Rehabilitation Center in Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province.
Prey Veng Provincial Police stated in its press release as follows:
Pursuant to the order of His Excellency General Sar Thet, the National Police Commissioner, the Provincial Police Commission sent the 11 police officers to the Drug Rehabilitation Center in Kandal Stung District, Kandal Province. In particular, the provincial police commission will strictly implement the rules and regulations in accordance with the decision-making principles of the management at a later time.
Prey Veng Provincial Police would like to thank you and be happy to receive constructive feedback from people from all walks of life, especially through the media, who have previously cooperated and continued to cooperate in the prevention and suppression of drug offenses. Both were selected by Prey Veng provincial police officers. ” Gaza death toll rises to more than 9,000, mostly women and children
