(Phnom Penh): The Rice Federation of Cambodia would like to thank all the farmers who have worked hard to cultivate, care for and provide fragrant rice grains that produce high quality rice, not only the beauty of rice grains. Good, leading to the gold award in the first China-ASEAN long grain white rice quality evaluation program in China.
