(Svay Rieng): Dr. Touch Poliva, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, said that the signing of the Memorandum of Understanding between Techo Sen Svay Rieng Polytechnic Institute and Zhao Hui Filters Co., Ltd. is another new step in which the private sector and the public sector have worked together. Closely in the sense of improving productivity and technical and vocational training.
Dr. Touch Poliva made this remark while the representative of the Governor of Svay Rieng Province attended the signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding between the Sen Svay Rieng Techo Polytechnic Institute and Zhao Hui Filters Co., Ltd. Held at the meeting hall of Techo Sen Svay Rieng Polytechnic Institute on the morning of November 2, 2023.
