According to Mr. Muth Chenda, Director of Techo Sen Svay Rieng Regional Institute, the institute has trained technical skills from the level of certification to the level of engineering bachelor in various fields such as electrical, electronic, mechanical, industrial, science, computer, mechanic, automobile, air conditioning, electrical system, problem system. Motor accounting and many other skills in line with market needs.
