BEIJING, China: Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, and Gao Xiang, President of the Chinese Academy of Social Sciences, praised the special traditional friendship between Cambodia and China. The two leaders are committed to building a community of common destiny of Cambodia and China with high quality and high standards in the new era.
Dr. Sok Touch and Mr. Cao Seang said this at the opening ceremony of the 3rd Cambodia-China Brain Bank High-Level Forum on "Strengthening the Building of a Cambodian-Chinese Community with a Common Destiny in a New Era" held at November 1, 2023 in Beijing, China.
Mr. Cao Seang quoted the royal speech of His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk, the King of Cambodia, as saying that "Cambodia-China friendship is like a flower under the sky."
Cao Xiang, meanwhile, stressed that Cambodia was the first country to respond to Chinese President Xi Jinping's proposal on the Belt and Road Initiative (BRI).
"Cambodia and China have always considered each other as equal partners and supported each other," he said. "As seen in recent years, a strong Cambodian-Chinese partnership has also been seen in agricultural and infrastructure cooperation and the new airport in Siem Reap."
Dr. Sok Touch praised the great cooperation established and maintained by the two countries. "Cambodia and China have jointly developed their cooperation, namely iron friendship, all-round partnership and diamond cooperation," Dr. Sok Touch said.
On that occasion, Mr. Sok Touch also proposed closer cooperation in agriculture, tourism and water resources, emphasizing that "without water, there is no agriculture, tourism and transportation."
