The victim, Sun Bunhong, said that he had lodged a complaint with the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police to ask the commissioner to provide him with justice on October 21, 2023. In the complaint, the victim demanded that the perpetrator pay $ 15,000 in medical expenses, medical expenses, loss of honor, dignity and loss of time, and that the perpetrator be brought to justice.
The victim stated that after he filed a complaint with the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police, the Kampong Leng District Governor also called both parties to mediate at Kampong Leng District Hall twice, but the mediation Not achieved. The families of the young victims decided to file a complaint against five police officers of the Kampong Leng District Police Inspectorate to the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Prosecutor's Office on October 30, 2023.
In the complaint, the victim demanded $ 15,000 in mental health and medical expenses and asked the court to convict the victim according to the law.
The victim continued that when he complained to the perpetrator to the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police, there were only three names because he did not know the names of the other two perpetrators who participated in the violence. On his body, when he went to court, he also complained about the names of the above five people.
The mother of the victim claimed that she, the mother, did not want to lose anything, just ask the authorities to follow the legal procedures, her family will be satisfied.
Regarding this case, Mr. Pol Vuthy, Deputy Commissioner for Criminal Planning of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police, told Fresh News Agency on the afternoon of October 31, 2023, this case, on October 30, 2023, the Commissioner invited both parties to work. Ask to find out the real reason because he is busy attending the meeting at the party headquarters, so he will continue to solve this case and take action later.
Separately, Brigadier General Ear Bunthoeun, Deputy Commissioner for Planning and Spokesman of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police on the afternoon of October 31, 2023, emphasized that the Commissioner is working on this case, so please wait a bit. As the commissioner is taking steps gradually, the results will be announced later.
Please be reminded that this case happened on the night of October 20, 2023, when a young man claimed that he was beaten by a group of police officers of the Kampong Leng District Police Inspectorate and used an electric baton on his body. Injured many places in the concert program that took place on the river in front of the police station in Kampong Leng district.
