(Pursat): Mr. Khoy Rida, Governor of Pursat Province, this afternoon, October 31, 2023, met with 660 12th grade students of Pursat High School and Hun Sen Tea Chamrat High School, Pursat City, who were preparing for the exam. High school diploma 2023.
