The following is the sub-decree of the Prime Minister: Senior officials of the National Bank call on people to deposit money at their trusted microfinance institutions
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Yim Lat, Deputy Governor General of the National Bank of Cambodia, called on people to save money at their trusted microfinance institutions.
Mr. Yim Lat spoke at the dissemination workshop on "ASEAN Savings Day" for 2023 under the theme "Saving habits for you and your family" in collaboration with the Banking Association of Cambodia and the Cambodian Microfinance Association. October 31, 2023 at Stung Sen Park.
He added that the organization of the ASEAN Day is to contribute to the promotion and improvement of the financial environment in line with the National Strategy on Financial Environment 2019-2025 to promote savings as well as "Increase awareness of the benefits of opening a savings account."
He added that at the same time, the National Bank of Cambodia has issued relevant regulations, which is a driving force for the banking and financial sector to expand all kinds of infrastructure, which makes it easier for customers and the public to use a variety of banking services safely. Easy, fast, quick.
He added that some of our people still have the misconception that only with a lot of income can you start saving, or only take the income minus the expenses and then the rest for saving and so on. So we should save some money for saving for ourselves as well as loved ones like our topic today "Habits to save money for you and your family".
"Saving money is an important and necessary financial challenge to meet unforeseen financial needs in the future, such as illnesses and emergencies," he said. It is also part of the financial management of individuals and families to ensure financial stability.
At the same time, a good saving habit is to save money with formal banking and financial institutions, because saving with these formal institutions provides safe care and protection of our savings, provides income, and additional savings. Legal protection and help us plan for the future clearly.
Ms. Lum Kuntheary, Deputy Governor of Kampong Thom Province, said that the commercial bank has 10 branches, 6 deposit microfinance institutions and 11 rural microfinance institutions.
She requested all microfinance and credit banks to provide services to the people as soon as possible in a timely manner, continue to implement professional ethics, strengthen and expand capacity and comply with all the guidelines of the National Bank of Cambodia. Real quality and efficiency.
