"This is a process of implementing the Law on the Administration of the Capital, Provinces, Municipalities, Districts and Khans, which stipulates that the establishment of a unified administration at the sub-national level is aimed at strengthening the unit," he said. Of the state to coordinate all public administration activities in its territory.
Mr. HUN Srithy stated that the organization of the workshop on the integration of the three-year rolling investment program 2024-2026 of Sangkat Khan now aims to promote the priority investment project 2024 of Khan administration, promote the investment project 2024 priority of Sangkat administration. And requesting project support from departments, specialized units, development partners, the private sector, and philanthropists to support Sangkat and Khan projects.
He added that every year, in each district, a workshop on the integration of the three-year rolling investment program of the commune and district according to the national guidelines, and this year, the integration workshop started from October 25 to 2. November 2023 in each district.
This workshop is organized in accordance with the five-year development plan of both Sangkat and Khan, in which it needs the support of specialized departments, development partners, philanthropists and the private sector so that the planned project reflects the priority needs at the local level. Resources to target and implement effectively.
According to the projects in the integration workshop in 2023, the following are as follows: Khan projects have received a total of 181 projects, 125 projects have been implemented and 56 projects are being implemented.
