Regarding Sunrise Hospital, Mr. Kamat said, "Currently, we have two major centers: First, Sunrise Japanese Hospital in Phnom Penh, located in Chroy Changvar, and second, Sunrise Sen Sok Center at Aeon Mall 2, with many services such as the center. "General diseases, emergency, neurological, cerebral, gastrointestinal, cancer, pediatrics, obstetrics, gynecology and health checks."
He vowed that the hospital will strive to improve the quality to contribute to the development of the health sector in Cambodia to grow even more. The focus on Japanese standard medical care and patient-centered treatment has developed into a multi-specialist hospital with a team of doctors, nurses as well as staff from all walks of life striving to provide care. Greatest health for Cambodians.
Sunrise Japan Hospital, located in the center of Phnom Penh, around Chroy Changvar, on October 29, 2023, celebrated the 7th anniversary of its opening with a series of events such as a first aid workshop on stroke. Increased fever, awareness of stroke, gastritis and side effects, rehabilitation for patients after a stroke or stroke, and more.
In 2014, the construction process of Japan Sunrise Phnom Penh Hospital started, during this construction also sent a team of doctors, nurses as well as staff from all departments who will be involved in the operation of Japan Sunrise Hospital Phnom Penh for further training. At the hospital in Japan to ensure that all services that will be provided to the people of Cambodia are in line with the medical quality of Japan.
Sunrise Hospital has been trusted and supported by patients since its opening. All of these factors provide the motivation to continue the effort by adhering to the four principles and promises (4Ps): treatment that prioritizes patients, early diagnosis and treatment, and care for them. Consistent and detailed explanation of the disease situation to the patient and family.
In 2018, the Children's Center began to serve patients in addition to the existing medical centers. In order to have full care for all ages in September 2020, the hospital opened a gynecology and obstetrics department in November of the same year.
The hospital's latest achievement is the establishment of Sun Wise Sen Sok Medical Center in April 2023 to provide you with health protection, early general treatment and early intervention of various diseases. The disease reaches an acute stage that can be life-threatening.
At the same time, the students also learned about the newly built fish ladder in Sleng village, Kralanh district, Siem Reap province.
The study tour, led by the Australian Center for International Agricultural Research (ACIAR), was attended by representatives from the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
The Sleng fish ladder helps restore fish movement and reconnect the good waterway between the Tonle Sap Lake and the local communities along the river and fishing trails, which benefits them both socially and economically. The fish ladder will also help reduce the impact of irrigation development, such as dam regulators, on fish migration.
The fish ladder benefits the environment and the people as it allows the fish to move freely and access food sources and spawning grounds while maintaining a supply of fish for local fisheries. The fish ladder has been studied to boost the local economy as well as improve the livelihoods of people who depend on it.
