According to the civil aviation spokesman, there are currently seven airlines flying in and out of Siem Reap Angkor International Airport, including six foreign companies and one local company.
Please be informed that Siem Reap Angkor International Airport officially opened for flights on October 16, 2023.
Siem Reap Angkor International Airport has 38 berths and can handle 7 million air passengers per year for 2023 and reach 12 million passengers per year from 2040.
