Authorities and Khna Chhmar Commune Council, Samaki Meanchey District Explain to Local People and the Public Not to Be Confused in Past Media
(Kampong Chhnang): Due to the publication of untrue information a few days ago, which confuses the public to the authorities and a commune council in Samaki Meanchey district, Kampong Chhnang province about the project to build a health center in The commune, the commune authority and the commune council have explained to the public and the people so as not to confuse the commune authorities with the dissemination of information with the above-mentioned incitement.
Ms. Patterson confirmed that for the posting of the above information, there is an individual living in her locality. Initially, her commune administration planned to build a health center building to provide health services to local people, where the health center is located in her commune, and the budget for the construction is sufficient state budget. Separately, there is no land for construction yet.
But in her commune there is a plot of land that can be built, the size of the land is 43 x 100 meters, plus the access road is more than 40 meters, they sell for $ 19,000, the commune budget is enough for After the construction did not have the budget to buy the land, the commune authorities and councils, as well as all village authorities also met to discuss the budget deficit.
After the discussion, the meeting agreed to mobilize local people with a total population of 2,000 families and called on philanthropists, including leaders, to support as much as possible. Received the full amount of land price for the participation of the people, philanthropists and leaders, the commune chief and the commune council, as well as all the working group welcomed and received with great pleasure.
