(Kampong Chhnang): Ms. Ke Chanmony, Member of Parliament for Kampong Chhnang Constituency, in the morning of October 27, 2023, led a group of provincial party youths to visit and bring gifts from the Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province and the President of the Provincial CPP, including Donations from philanthropists distributed to 19 families affected by wind and flood damage in Peam Khnong village, Plou Touk commune, Kampong Leng district.
On that occasion, Ms. Ke Chanmony said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen always think about the well-being of people affected by natural disasters in all areas.
