Mr. Chheang Tharith, Chairman of the Provincial Party Youth Activist Group, said that the CPP's donation to the 19 families at this time, each family received 25 kg of rice, 1 can of fish sauce, 1 can of soy sauce. 1 box of scarves, 1 sarong, 1 new set of clothes and 100,000 Riels, while the families who suffered a complete collapse of their families received 300,000 Riels.
He confirmed that the above donation for rice belongs to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Party, which was given to the Provincial Governor and President of the Cambodian People's Party in Kampong Chhnang for distribution to the victims and other needs. .
Mr. Pat Kun, Commune / Sangkat Chief, on behalf of the village, commune and 19 families of the victims, would like to express his deep gratitude to Samdech Techo, President of the Cambodian People's Party, Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Chairman of the Provincial Party, Ms. Ke Chanmony, Member of Parliament for Kampong Chhnang. Together with the team and all the philanthropists who have spent their personal resources as a gift to the 19 families in the commune of Plou Touk, Kampong Leng above.
